sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant p0 as Clinician
    participant p1 as Clinical API
    participant p2 as Identity / Consent
    participant p3 as Patient DB
    participant p4 as Audit Store
    participant p5 as Lab Gateway
    p0->>p1: Request patient encounter
    p1->>p2: Check role, purpose and consent
    p2->>p1: Allow minimal necessary scope
    p1->>p3: Fetch scoped record
    p1->>p4: Log actor, purpose and access
    p1->>p0: Return authorized clinical summary
    p5->>p3: Ingest validated lab results
